{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261119/photo/bkn-20261119210429008-1119_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261119212524\"/><p>事發滙豐銀行總行。</p><p>今日(19日)中午12時46分，中環皇后大道中滙豐銀行總行職員報案，指一名持護照的67歲菲律賓籍女子，在上址出示虛假銀行文件。警員員接報到場，經初步調查後，以涉嫌「行使虛假文書」拘捕該名菲律賓籍女子，她現正被扣留調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T13:58:12.515185+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T13:04:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T15:32:47.629547+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T13:51:31.699589+00:00","content_hash":"6848c6472e2c6ed14c19a38493f4dde177c615376219ffdbf1a9c44fd7afa28a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T13:58:12.515185+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}